{"id": "22-977-2-2", "zh": "以 gacchanta 为首的词群", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-978-2-27", "zh": "127. 在 si 之前，nta 变为 aṃ〔ka.186；rū.107；nī.382-4；多数版本作“tassaṃ”〕。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-979-2-8", "zh": "在 si 之前，nta 可选地变为 aṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-979-9-10", "zh": "si 省略。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-980-2-74", "zh": "gacchaṃ、gacchanto，gacchantā、gacchanto；bho gaccha、bho gacchā、bho gacchaṃ，bhonto gacchantā、bhonto gacchanto；gacchantaṃ，gacchante；gacchantena、gacchatā，gacchantehi、gacchantebhi；gacchantassa、gacchato，gacchantānaṃ、gacchataṃ；gacchantasmā、gacchantamhā、gacchantā、gacchatā，gacchantehi、gacchantebhi；gacchantassa、gacchato，gacchantānaṃ、gacchataṃ；gacchantasmiṃ、gacchantamhi、gacchati、gacchante，gacchantesu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-981-2-49", "zh": "同样还有 karaṃ、kubbaṃ、caraṃ、cavaṃ、jayaṃ、jahaṃ、jānaṃ、jiraṃ、dadaṃ、dahaṃ、juhaṃ、suṇaṃ、pacaṃ、saraṃ、bhuñjaṃ、muñcaṃ、sayaṃ、saraṃ、haraṃ、tiṭṭhaṃ、bhavissaṃ、karissaṃ、gamissaṃ 等等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-982-2-3", "zh": "下面说明特殊的规定。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-983-2-25", "zh": "依“Ntassa ca ṭa vaṃse”这条规则，在 aṃ 等之前，nta 变为 ṭa：“yaṃ yañhi rāja bhajati, santaṃ vā yadi vā asaṃ”（国王啊，无论他亲近的是谁，是善人还是恶人，", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "22-983-26-42", "zh": "sīlavantaṃ visīlaṃ vā, vasaṃ tasseva gacchati”（是持戒的人还是破戒的人，他都会落入那个人的掌控）〔jā.1.15.181〕。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-983-43-59", "zh": "“kiccānukrubbassa kareyya kiccaṃ”（对回报所受恩惠的人，应当为他做事）〔jā.1.2.145〕——anukrubbassa 的意思是“再做的人的”。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "22-984-2-56", "zh": "依大规则（mahāvutti），在第一格 yo 之前，带格尾的 nta 也变为 aṃ：“api nu tumhe ekantasukhaṃ lokaṃ jānaṃ passaṃ viharatha”（你们是否知道、见到一个纯然安乐的世界而住？）〔dī.ni.1.425〕；“kasaṃ khettaṃ bījaṃ vapaṃ, dhanaṃ vindanti māṇavā”（年轻人耕田、播种，获得财富）〔therīgā.112〕；“bharanti mātāpitaro, pubbe katamanussaraṃ”（他们忆念父母先前的恩德，奉养父母）〔a.ni.5.39〕。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-985-2-15", "zh": "128. mahanta 与 arahanta 的 nta 可选地变为 ṭā〔nī.387，712〕。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-986-2-8", "zh": "在 si 之前，这两个词的 nta 可选地变为 ṭā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-987-2-29", "zh": "mahā、mahaṃ、mahanto，mahantā、mahanto；bho maha、bho mahā、bho mahaṃ，bhonto mahantā、bhonto mahanto；mahantaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-988-2-35", "zh": "依“Ntassa ca ṭa vaṃse”这条规则，在 aṃ 之前 nta 变为 ṭa，圣典中有“sumahaṃ puraṃ, parikkhipissan”（我将包围这座极大的城）〔jā.2.22.792〕，意思是“极其广大的波罗奈城”。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-988-36-38", "zh": "其余变化与 gacchanta 相同。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-989-2-4", "zh": "arahā tiṭṭhati（阿罗汉站着）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-989-5-59", "zh": "依“Ntassaṃ simhi”这条规则，在 si 之前 nta 变为 aṃ：“arahaṃ sugato loke”（世间的阿罗汉、善逝）〔saṃ.ni.1.161〕，“arahaṃ sammāsambuddho”（阿罗汉、正等正觉者）〔pārā.1〕；arahantā、arahanto，arahantaṃ、arahante，arahantena、arahatā，arahantehi、arahantebhi，arahantassa、arahato，arahantānaṃ、arahataṃ 等等。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-990-2-22", "zh": "依大规则，brahmanta 的 nta 在 si 之前也变为 ṭā：brahā、brahanto，brahantā、brahanto；brahantaṃ、brahante 等等。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-991-2-132", "zh": "圣典中有：“sā parisā mahā hoti, sā senā dissate mahā”（那个集会很大，那支军队看起来很庞大）〔jā.2.22.771〕；“mahā bhante bhūmicālo”（尊者，这次地震很大）〔a.ni.8.70〕；“mahā te upāsaka pariccāgo”（优婆塞，你的布施真大）〔jā.aṭṭha.4.13. akittijātakavaṇṇanā〕；“mahā me bhayamāgatan”（我遇上了大怖畏）；“bārāṇasirajjaṃ nāma mahā”（波罗奈王国是很大的）〔jā.aṭṭha.1.1. mahāsīlavajātakavaṇṇanā〕；“mahāssa honti parivārā brāhmaṇagahapatikā, mahāssa honti parivārā bhikkhū bhikkhuniyo”（他有众多婆罗门和居士作为眷属，他有众多比丘和比丘尼作为眷属）〔dī.ni.3.204〕；“mahā vahanti dudiṭṭhiṃ, saṅkappā rāganissitā”（依附于贪欲的种种思惟，强力地把邪见的人带走）。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "22-991-133-137", "zh": "这里的 mahā 一词也可能是近似不变词（nipātapaṭirūpaka）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-992-2-6", "zh": "129. 来自 bhū 的。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-993-2-7", "zh": "由 bhū 词根构成的词，其 nta 在 si 之前变为 aṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-993-8-13", "zh": "单独使用时一定如此，带前缀时则不一定。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-994-2-43", "zh": "bhavaṃ tiṭṭhati（尊者站着）；sampattiṃ anubhavaṃ、anubhavanto（享受成就）；taṇhaṃ abhibhavaṃ、abhibhavanto（降伏渴爱）；dukkhaṃ paribhavaṃ、paribhavanto tiṭṭhati（轻视苦而住）；bhavantā、bhavanto；he bhavanta、he bhavantā、he bhavanto、he bhava、he bhavā、he bhavaṃ。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-994-44-63", "zh": "圣典中有“kacci bhavaṃ abhiramasi araññe”（尊者在林中过得快乐吗？）〔jā.2.18.18〕。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-995-2-57", "zh": "he bhavantā、he bhavanto；bhavantaṃ、bhavante；bhavantena、bhavatā，bhavantehi、bhavantebhi；bhavantassa、bhavato，bhavantānaṃ、bhavataṃ；bhavantasmā、bhavantamhā、bhavantā、bhavatā，bhavantehi、bhavantebhi；bhavantassa、bhavato，bhavantānaṃ、bhavataṃ；bhavantasmiṃ、bhavantamhi、bhavati、bhavante，bhavantesu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-996-2-24", "zh": "130. 在 ga、yo、nā、se 之前，bhavanta 可选地变为 bhonta〔ka.243；rū.8，110；nī.484〕。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-997-2-13", "zh": "在 ga、yo、nā、sa 之前，bhavanta 可选地变为 bhonta。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-997-14-23", "zh": "依规则的拆分（suttavibhatta），在 aṃ、hi、naṃ、smā 等之前也是如此。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-998-2-64", "zh": "bhontā、bhonto；he bhonta、he bhontā、he bhonto；bhontaṃ、bhonte；bhontena、bhotā，bhontehi、bhontebhi；bhontassa、bhoto，bhontānaṃ、bhotaṃ；bhontasmā、bhontamhā、bhontā、bhotā，bhontehi、bhontebhi；bhontassa、bhoto，bhontānaṃ、bhotaṃ；bhontasmiṃ、bhontamhi、bhoti、bhonte，bhontesu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-999-2-68", "zh": "bho 和 bhante 这两个词，是以增长（vuddhi）的意义构成的，在称呼的意义上就是不变词，它们之后的 ga、yo 省略：“ito bho sugatiṃ gaccha”（贤者啊，从这里往生善趣吧）〔itivu.83〕；“ummujja bho puthusile”（大石头啊，浮上来吧）；“kuto nu āgacchatha bho tayo janā”（三位贤者，你们从哪里来？）〔jā.1.9.87〕；“passatha bho imaṃ kulaputtaṃ”（诸位，请看这位良家子）；“ehi bhante khamāpehi”（尊者，来请求原谅吧）；“so te bhikkhū khamāpesi ‘khamatha bhante’”（他请求那些比丘原谅，说：‘尊者们，请原谅我。’）。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "22-999-69-127", "zh": "同样，bhaddante 和 bhaddantā 这两个词，是以“tuyhaṃ bhaddaṃ hotu, tumhākaṃ bhaddaṃ hotu”（愿你吉祥，愿你们吉祥）的意义构成的称呼不变词：“‘bhaddante’ti te bhikkhū bhagavato paccassosuṃ”（那些比丘回应世尊说：‘尊者！’）〔saṃ.ni.1.249〕；“taṃ vo vadāmi bhaddante, yāvantettha samāgatā”（愿你们吉祥！我要对聚集在这里的所有人说这件事）〔jā.1.7.108〕。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-999-128-134", "zh": "而 bhaddanta、bhadanta 这两个词则属于 purisa 等词群。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1000-2-11", "zh": "santa 一词用于“善人”“存在”“现有”的意义时，归在这里。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "22-1000-12-24", "zh": "“sameti asatā asaṃ”（恶人与恶人相投合）〔jā.1.2.16〕。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-1000-25-51", "zh": "saṃ、santo，santā、santo；bhosanta、bhosantā、bhosa、bho sā 或 bho saṃ，bhonto santā、bhonto santo。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1000-52-71", "zh": "“yaṃ yañhi rāja bhajati, santaṃ vā yadi vā asaṃ”（国王啊，无论他亲近的是谁，是善人还是恶人）〔jā.1.15.180〕。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-1000-72-77", "zh": "sante；santena、satā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1001-2-21", "zh": "131. 在 bh 之前，santa 变为 sabba〔ka.185；rū.112；nī.378〕。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-1002-2-8", "zh": "在 bh 之前，santa 可选地替换为 sab。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-1003-2-47", "zh": "santehi、santebhi、sabbhi；santassa、sato，santānaṃ、sataṃ；santasmā、santamhā、santā、satā，santehi、santebhi、sabbhi；santassa、sato，santānaṃ、sataṃ；santasmiṃ、santamhi、sati、sante，santesu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-1003-48-87", "zh": "“santo sappurisā loke”（善人就是世间的正人）；“dūre santo pakāsenti”（善人即使在远处也会显现）〔dha.pa.304〕；“cattāro puggalā santo saṃvijjamānā lokasmiṃ”（世间存在、现有四种人）〔a.ni.4.85〕；“pahu santo na bharati”（虽然有能力，却不奉养）〔su.ni.91〕。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-1004-2-25", "zh": "用于疲倦和止息意义的 santa，属于 purisa 等词群：“dīghaṃ santassa yojanaṃ”（对疲倦的人来说，一由旬很长）〔dha.pa.61〕；“santā honti samitā niruddhā”（已经平息、寂止、灭尽）等等。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-1005-2-4", "zh": "以 gacchanta 为首的词群至此结束。", "confidence": 85}
